.\" Manual page for rdpd.conf(5).  mdoc format.
.Dd May 25, 2026
.Dt RDPD.CONF 5
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm rdpd.conf
.Nd configuration file for the Remote Desktop Protocol server
.Sh DESCRIPTION
There is no configuration file yet.
All options are passed as command-line flags to
.Xr rdpd 8
and
.Xr rdp-sessionmgr 8 .
.Pp
.Nm
will eventually hold the runtime configuration for
.Xr rdpd 8 :
listen address, TLS certificate path, allowed authentication
backends, channel allow-list, session command, and per-user limits.
.Pp
The current command-line flags for
.Xr rdpd 8
are:
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl A
Enable auto-login (skip greeter, use Client Info credentials).
.It Fl d
Enable debug logging.
.It Fl f
Run in the foreground; log to stderr.
.It Fl h Ar host
Bind address (default: all).
.It Fl p Ar port
Listen port (default 3389).
.It Fl S Ar socket
Path to the
.Xr rdp-sessionmgr 8
AF_UNIX socket.
.El
.Pp
The current command-line flags for
.Xr rdp-sessionmgr 8
are:
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl d
Enable debug logging.
.It Fl f
Run in the foreground; log to stderr.
.It Fl s Ar path
Listen socket path (default
.Pa /var/run/rdpserver/sessmgr.sock ) .
.It Fl u Ar user
Drop privileges to this user after bind.
.It Fl S Ar name
PAM service name (default
.Ql login ) .
.It Fl X Ar path
Path to the
.Xr rdp-session 8
binary (default
.Pa /usr/local/sbin/rdp-session ) .
.El
.Pp
The current command-line flags for
.Xr rdp-session 8
are:
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl D
Use the native Xorg DDX driver instead of Xvfb.
.It Fl W
Use the Wayland compositor instead of X11.
.It Fl w Ar width
Desktop width (default 1024).
.It Fl H Ar height
Desktop height (default 768).
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr rdpd 8 ,
.Xr rdp-sessionmgr 8 ,
.Xr rdp-session 8
